# Muse Maker — Muse only. No API keys live here.
# Auth is your Muse login on this machine: run `muse login` once.
# This file only picks WHICH Muse models your team uses. Copy to .env to change them.

# Superagent (ordering + assigning). Default: muse-wonder-1.0
# MUSE_MODEL_PLANNER=muse-wonder-1.0

# Subagents (the hands-on work). Default: muse-spark-1.3
# MUSE_MODEL_WORKER=muse-spark-1.3

# Or one model for everyone:
# MUSE_MODEL=muse-spark-1.3

# Optional reasoning effort for Muse runs: none|minimal|low|medium|high|xhigh|max|ultra
# MUSE_REASONING_EFFORT=high
